s":"water"}],"gloss":"water"},{"surface":"கொண்டு","parts":[{"text":"கொண்டு","lemma":"கொள்","gloss":"having taken"}],"gloss":"having taken"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"விசும்பு","parts":[{"text":"விசும்பு","lemma":"விசும்பு","gloss":"sky"}],"gloss":"sky"},{"surface":"இவர்","parts":[{"text":"இவர்","lemma":"இவர்","gloss":"rising / climbing"}],"gloss":"rising"},{"surface":"கல்லாது","parts":[{"text":"கல்","lemma":"கல்","gloss":"learn"},{"text":"ஆது","lemma":"ஆது","gloss":"without / unable to"}],"gloss":"unable to climb"},{"surface":"தாங்குபு","parts":[{"text":"தாங்கு","lemma":"தாங்கு","gloss":"bearing"},{"text":"பு","lemma":"பு","gloss":"verbal participle suffix"}],"gloss":"bearing"},{"surface":"புணரி","parts":[{"text":"புணரி","lemma":"புணரி","gloss":"ocean"}],"gloss":"ocean"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"செழும்","parts":[{"text":"செழும்","lemma":"செழுமை","gloss":"fertile / rich"}],"gloss":"fertile"},{"surface":"பல்","parts":[{"text":"பல்","lemma":"பல","gloss":"many"}],"gloss":"many"},{"surface":"குன்றம்","parts":[{"text":"குன்றம்","lemma":"குன்றம்","gloss":"hills"}],"gloss":"hills"},{"surface":"நோக்கி","parts":[{"text":"நோக்கி","lemma":"நோக்கு","gloss":"looking at"}],"gloss":"looking at"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பெருங்கலி","parts":[{"text":"பெருமை","lemma":"பெருமை","gloss":"great"},{"text":"கலி","lemma":"கலி","gloss":"sound / roar"}],"gloss":"loudly roaring"},{"surface":"வானம்","parts":[{"text":"வானம்","lemma":"வானம்","gloss":"sky / cloud"}],"gloss":"clouds"},{"surface":"ஏர்தரும்","parts":[{"text":"ஏர்","lemma":"ஏர்","gloss":"rising"},{"text":"தரும்","lemma":"தரு","gloss":"giving / doing"}],"gloss":"rising up"},{"surface":"பொழுதே","parts":[{"text":"பொழுது","lemma":"பொழுது","gloss":"time"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"at the very time"}]}],"literal":"Listen! May you live long, friend! The lover / even now, having seen, will he abandon indeed? / Twelve months bearing the weight, having become weary, / unable to walk, desiring sour green tamarind, / like heavily pregnant women, holding water, / unable to climb the sky, bearing [the weight], from the ocean / towards the fertile, many hills, / when the loudly roaring clouds rise up!","translation":"Listen, my friend, may you live long! Will our lover really abandon us, even after seeing this season? The clouds, like heavily pregnant women who have borne their heavy load for twelve months, weary and unable to walk, craving sour green tamarind, have taken in water from the ocean. Unable to climb high into the sky, they move slowly, bearing their weight, heading towards the many fertile hills as they rise up with a loud roar.","modern":"தோழியே! கேள், நீ டூழி வாழ்க! பன்னிரண்டு மாதங்கள் கருவைத் தாங்கி, களைப்படைந்து, நடக்க இயலாமல், பசிய புளிப்பான மாங்காயை விரும்பும் கர்பிணிப் பெண்களைப் போல, கடலில் இருந்து நீரை முகந்து கொண்டு, வானத்தில் மேலே ஏற முடியாமல் பாரத்தைத் தாங்கிக் கொண்டு, செழுமையான பல மலைகளை நோக்கி, முழக்கமிடும் மேகங்கள் எழுகின்ற இந்த கார்ப்பருவத்தைக் கண்டும் நம் காதலர் நம்மைப் பிரிந்திருப்பாரோ?","explanation":"The friend is speaking to the anxious heroine during the rainy season, which is the Mullai landscape's characteristic time. The lover had promised to return before the rains, and the friend reassures the heroine that he will not abandon her now that the season has arrived. The poem features a vivid simile comparing the rain-bearing clouds to heavily pregnant women. Just as pregnant women carry their heavy load for twelve months, feel weary, find it difficult to walk, and crave sour green tamarind, the clouds are heavy with water from the ocean, move low and slow, and head towards the hills. Key words include 'முந்நான்கு திங்கள்' (twelve months), 'கடுஞ்சூல் மகளிர்' (heavily pregnant women), and 'பசும்புளி வேட்கை' (craving for sour green tamarind).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.6],[0.6,0.9],[0.9,1.2],[1.38,1.92],[2.1,2.5],[2.5,3.0],[3.0,3.15],[3.3,4.1],[4.2,4.5],[4.64,5.0],[5.0,5.4],[5.4,6.4],[6.4,6.5],[6.5,7.12],[7.3,7.7],[7.7,8.